## 📊 Monitoring y Debugging

### Logs Estratégicos

```dart
// En servicio
debugPrint('Stream error: $error');
debugPrint('Reconnecting in ${delay}s (attempt ${_reconnectAttempts + 1})');

// En providers
debugPrint('Evento seleccionado: $eventoId');
